# agent review transcripts

# The verdict, review mode, shell probe, trust level and timings all live in the committed
# REVIEW-*.md header. The transcript is the raw reviewer stream - tens of KB each, largely the
# echoed prompt. It is written to the MAIN checkout so it survives worktree removal, but it is
# local diagnostic detail, not repository history.
.agents/reviews/*.transcript.log

# per-review shell-probe token, created and deleted by review.ps1
.agents/.review-nonce-*

